registerInboxCommands(program);
registerMetaCommands(program);
// ... more registrations

// Error handling for unknown commands
program.on("command:*", (operands) => {
  // Suggest closest match
});

export { program };
```

#### Shadow Commit Pattern (used by all mutating commands)
```typescript
